<title>NETHERLANDS: Rodamco to buy Barclays' British property.</title>
<headline>Rodamco to buy Barclays' British property.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property investment fund Rodamco NV said on Monday it was at an advanced stage of negotiations with Britain's Barclays Bank Plc on the takeover of Barclays' IMRY British property portfolio.</p>
<p>&quot;The negotiations are expected to be completed within a few weeks,&quot; Rodamco said without giving details about the value of the property to be bought.</p>
